        <div class="lvg-truth-scorecard__two">

          
            <div>
              <p>It is not a lecture about minimalism, and it is not a trend anybody here discovered. It is a name for something a great many people were already reaching for and doing badly: getting the most out of the skin they have, rather than buying the most products about it.</p>
            </div>
          

          
            <div>
              <p>The working definition. Unlocking your skin's peak beauty potential — not by using more products, but by using a smarter, focused, multi-repair system consistently. Maxxing means working towards a maximum over time, progressively. Your own maximum, measured against your own skin. Never somebody else's.</p>
